WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.593 --> 00:00:06.454
"Oh no!"

2
00:00:14.117 --> 00:00:14.997
said Detective Smith.

3
00:00:15.017 --> 00:00:18.939
"That monster will destroy the Metro City Convention Center!

4
00:00:20.159 --> 00:00:22.620
We must Rocket Girl?"

5
00:00:26.762 --> 00:00:29.343
Roxy landed in front of the Metro City Convention Center.

6
00:00:30.303 --> 00:00:31.784
The building's roof was gone.

7
00:00:32.620 --> 00:00:34.682
Broken glass and bricks were everywhere.

8
00:00:37.104 --> 00:00:38.225
People ran out of the building.

9
00:00:40.347 --> 00:00:42.349
"A monster ate my flowers!"

10
00:00:42.569 --> 00:00:43.150
cried a man.

11
00:00:43.170 --> 00:00:46.012
"Run for your lives!"

12
00:00:46.333 --> 00:00:48.455
shouted a woman carrying an empty flowerpot.

13
00:00:49.455 --> 00:00:53.139
Rooaarr! The ground shook.

14
00:00:56.842 --> 00:00:58.564
A shadow fell over the convention center.

15
00:01:00.988 --> 00:01:03.229
A huge monster stood up from behind the building.

16
00:01:07.610 --> 00:01:09.871
The monster had green scales and a long tail.

17
00:01:10.731 --> 00:01:12.171
It looked like a giant reptile.

18
00:01:13.792 --> 00:01:14.512
Roxy gulped.

19
00:01:15.412 --> 00:01:17.493
"The monster is bigger than I thought!"

20
00:01:19.033 --> 00:01:24.015
Rooaarr! The monster reached into the convention center.

21
00:01:25.955 --> 00:01:27.716
It pulled out a bunch of roses and ate them.

22
00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:31.361
The monster burped loudly.

23
00:01:34.563 --> 00:01:36.805
Then it turned and walked away from the convention center.

24
00:01:42.829 --> 00:01:45.711
The monster sniffed and pulled all the flowers out of a garden.

25
00:01:48.252 --> 00:01:49.333
Then it walked some more.

26
00:01:49.353 --> 00:01:54.176
"I have to stop that monster!"

27
00:01:54.377 --> 00:01:54.997
said Roxy.

28
00:01:55.017 --> 00:01:58.519
"It's headed for Mara's neighborhood!"

29
00:02:00.064 --> 00:02:01.425
Roxy shot after the monster.

30
00:02:02.907 --> 00:02:06.130
Whiz-hoo! She fired her eye laser beams.

31
00:02:07.251 --> 00:02:09.012
The laser beams bounced off the monster.

32
00:02:11.975 --> 00:02:13.216
The monster spun around.

33
00:02:13.236 --> 00:02:19.482
Rooaarr! It batted Roxy, knocking her onto a roof.

34
00:02:22.225 --> 00:02:24.947
The monster walked some more, sniffing and eating flowers.

35
00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:30.322
Jack, Terrell, and Mara looked up from Mara's backyard.

36
00:02:30.342 --> 00:02:33.065
"Whoa!" cried Jack.

37
00:02:33.085 --> 00:02:35.847
"It's a huge monster!"

38
00:02:36.087 --> 00:02:36.748
cried Terrell.

39
00:02:39.751 --> 00:02:41.192
Roxy flew after the monster.

40
00:02:41.212 --> 00:02:45.796
"My eye laser beams didn't work," she thought.

41
00:02:45.816 --> 00:02:47.778
"I need something else."

42
00:02:49.579 --> 00:02:51.060
She spotted a big water tank.

43
00:02:52.842 --> 00:02:54.724
She lifted it and shot toward the monster.

44
00:02:56.972 --> 00:02:57.792
"Look!" shouted Mara.

45
00:02:57.812 --> 00:02:59.693
"Rocket Girl!"

46
00:03:00.714 --> 00:03:02.535
Roxy threw the water tank at the monster.

47
00:03:03.115 --> 00:03:04.196
The tank burst open.

48
00:03:06.637 --> 00:03:08.938
Water dumped onto Mara, Jack, and Terrell.

49
00:03:10.439 --> 00:03:12.961
Rooaarr! "Uh-oh!"

50
00:03:13.141 --> 00:03:13.821
thought Roxy.

51
00:03:13.841 --> 00:03:16.422
"The monster is angry now!"

52
00:03:17.503 --> 00:03:19.984
The monster ran toward Roxy and batted her again.

53
00:03:21.385 --> 00:03:22.586
Roxy ducked out of the way.

54
00:03:22.606 --> 00:03:24.447
"Ha!" she said.

55
00:03:24.467 --> 00:03:26.628
"You can't Whoa!"

56
00:03:27.648 --> 00:03:30.530
The monster whipped its tail, knocking Roxy far away.

57
00:03:31.570 --> 00:03:33.691
She landed with a crash on the other side of the city.

58
00:03:34.692 --> 00:03:36.853
Roxy quickly flew back to Mara's neighborhood.

59
00:03:38.074 --> 00:03:40.135
Now the monster was heading up into the mountains.

60
00:03:41.656 --> 00:03:44.137
Boom, boom, boom!

61
00:03:44.958 --> 00:03:45.798
A mountain shook.

62
00:03:47.059 --> 00:03:48.860
A boulder broke loose and started to roll.

63
00:03:50.220 --> 00:03:52.362
Then another boulder broke loose, and another.

64
00:03:53.762 --> 00:03:56.364
Soon lots of boulders were rolling fast down the mountain.

65
00:03:57.484 --> 00:03:59.266
They were headed right toward some buildings.

66
00:03:59.286 --> 00:04:02.608
"Uh-oh!" cried Roxy.

67
00:04:02.628 --> 00:04:06.171
"Those boulders will smash into Metro City!"
